# The approval mode menu beside the composer lists the three modes, applies one
# to the composer and closes with Escape. As in the GPUI client, choosing a mode
# keeps the menu open.
expect "何に取り組みますか？" 30000
press 承認方法を変更
expect "承認を求める"
expect "代わりに承認"
expect "フルアクセス"
screenshot modes
press フルアクセス
expect_absent "カスタム・未設定"
key escape
expect_absent "承認の確認なしで操作を実行します"
expect "フルアクセス"
screenshot applied
